#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_House2/scripts.inc:12
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_House2_Text_NormanBecameGymLeader"
msgid ""
"NORMAN became our town's new\n"
"GYM LEADER.\p"
"I think he called his family over from\n"
"somewhere far away.$"
msgstr ""
"千里成为了我们镇上\n"
"新的道馆馆主。\p"
"我记得他好像把家人\n"
"从很远的地方接过来了。$"

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_House2/scripts.inc:18
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_House2_Text_BattledNormanOnce"
msgid ""
"I battled NORMAN once, but, whew,\n"
"he was way too strong.\p"
"How would I put it?\p"
"I just got the feeling that he\n"
"lives for POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"我和千里对战过一次，\n"
"可是，唉，他实在太强了。\p"
"该怎么说呢？\p"
"我感觉他就是\n"
"为了宝可梦而活的。$"
